## 5. Mobs

```json
"mobs": [
  {
    "mob": "minecraft:pillager",
    "amount": 6,
    "avoid_line_of_sight": true,
    "persistent": true,
    "target": "owner",
    "friendly_fire": false,
    "equipment": {
      "mainhand": "minecraft:crossbow",
      "head": "minecraft:iron_helmet"
    }
  }
]
```

| Field | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `mob` | Entity id. |
| `amount` | How many to spawn. |
| `avoid_line_of_sight` | Spawn only where the player cannot currently see the spot. Strongly recommended. |
| `persistent` | Survives despawn rules. |
| `target` | `owner` makes them hunt the triggering player. |
| `friendly_fire` | Whether they can hurt each other. |
| `equipment` | Slot → item id. |

