## Compatibility

Create, Create Aeronautics/Simulated, Sable and Create Big Cannons are all
**optional**. Plain entity, sound, effect and structure encounters work with
none of them installed. Definitions that need a missing mod are hidden at load
rather than erroring — `/ambush admin check` reports which and why.
